# Directories the autoload generator must not walk.
#
# Every entry is anchored at the installation root, so "vendor" means
# <root>/vendor and nothing else.
#
# vendor/ is Composer's. Its classes are resolved by Composer's own
# autoloader, and sweeping them into the kernel array duplicates that
# mapping in a second place that nothing keeps up to date -- a -k run here
# pulled in 509 MongoDB classes, 51 files from the bundled web server
# including its test fixtures, and assorted polyfill stubs.
#
# ai/ holds tooling and one-off scripts, not application classes.
#
# var/ holds caches and compiled templates, which are generated output.
vendor
ai
var
